#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:244
#: 7bf5020d8008401cb04796a67d905085
msgid ""
"Return to the *home location* or the nearest `Rally Point <common-rally-"
"points>`__, if closer. The home location is where the vehicle was last "
"armed (or when it first gets GPS lock after arming if the vehicle "
"configuration allows this)."
msgstr ""
"返回 *Home 位置*，或返回最近的 `集结点 <common-rally-points>`__（如果更近）。Home "
"位置是飞行器最后一次解锁的位置（如果飞行器配置允许，则为解锁后首次获得 GPS 锁定的位置）。"

