#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:351
#: d080633448fe40f8b7a2756489c36e18
msgid "MAV_CMD_DO_JUMP"
msgstr "MAV_CMD_DO_JUMP"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:355
#: b13c0bc7d67c4c12a67955ec91d7907d
msgid ""
"Jump to the specified command in the mission list. The jump command can "
"be repeated either a specified number of times before continuing the "
"mission, or it can be repeated indefinitely."
msgstr "跳转到任务列表中指定的指令。跳转指令可以在继续任务前重复指定次数，也可以无限期重复。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:361
#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:508
#: 03a88f881aab458682c2699f313c1f1a fe639c55058c4465a7174ec3ffe156ab
msgid ""
"Despite the name, this command is really a \"NAV\\_\" command rather than"
" a \"DO\\_\" command. Conditional commands like CONDITION_DELAY don't "
"affect DO_JUMP (it will always perform the jump as soon as it reaches the"
" command)."
msgstr ""
"尽管名称如此，此指令实际上是 「NAV\\_」 指令而非 「DO\\_」 指令。CONDITION_DELAY 等条件指令不影响 "
"DO_JUMP（飞行器到达该指令时会立即执行跳转）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:368
#: f27b37d169a342f38c35703ccc71f8b1
msgid ""
"There can be a maximum of 15 jump commands in a mission after which new "
"DO_JUMP commands are ignored."
msgstr "一次任务中最多可有 15 条跳转指令，超出后新的 DO_JUMP 指令将被忽略。"

