#: 57eafbf76bc1484d9f8b9c653d1e8076
msgid ""
"Set a given :ref:`servo pin <common-servo>` output to a specific PWM "
"value."
msgstr "将指定的 :ref:`舵机引脚 <common-servo>` 输出设置为特定 PWM 值。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:1058
#: 3d639d56a035473bb69d2a9254b133e3
msgid "Mission Planner Settingsfor DO_SET_SERVO command"
msgstr "DO_SET_SERVO 指令的 Mission Planner 设置"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:1060
#: 90ae40f0e827454a8d2674f4410c1a4a
msgid ""
"In the example above, the servo attached to output channel 8 would be "
"moved to PWM 1700 (servos generally accept PWM values between 1000 and "
"2000)."
msgstr "在上述示例中，连接到输出通道 8 的舵机将移动到 PWM 1700（舵机通常接受 1000 到 2000 之间的 PWM 值）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:1064
#: 0b9ed94f3dfe4b3eae1ff67c50024b4d
msgid ""
"as of firmware versions 4.0 and later, this command can be used on any "
"output configured by its ``SERVOx_FUNCTION`` command as 0,1, or 51-66  "
"(disabled or RC pass-throughs)"
msgstr "从固件 4.0 版本起，此指令可用于任何通过 ``SERVOx_FUNCTION`` 命令配置为 0、1 或 51-66（禁用或 RC 直通）的输出"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:1069
#: 6ce37fa819c541d6b5a4c05d40e365b8
msgid "MAV_CMD_DO_REPEAT_SERVO"
msgstr "MAV_CMD_DO_REPEAT_SERVO"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:1073
#: e5b6309c2c3a4235814836a711b582f5
msgid ""
"Cycle a :ref:`servo <common-servo>` PWM output pin between its mid-"
"position value and a specified PWM value, for a given number of cycles "
"and with a set period."
msgstr "在给定周期和设定次数内，将 :ref:`舵机 <common-servo>` PWM 输出引脚在其中间位置值和指定 PWM 值之间循环切换。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:1077
#: 523241887d0643fbb8c61ded19282a0a
msgid ""
"The mid-position value is specified in the ``RCn_TRIM`` parameter for the"
" channel (``RC8_TRIM`` in the screenshot below). The default value is "
"1500.."
msgstr "中间位置值在该通道的 ``RCn_TRIM`` 参数中指定（下方截图中为 ``RC8_TRIM``）。默认值为 1500。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:1135
#: 5d23fb6e98d74089be8c6ce9cdb12a7f
msgid "Mission Planner Settingsfor DO_REPEAT_SERVO command"
msgstr "DO_REPEAT_SERVO 指令的 Mission Planner 设置"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:1137
#: 60a84153d4ce4c63bb2a3484eafd59e6
msgid ""
"In the example above, the servo attached to output channel 8 would be "
"moved to PWM 1700, then after 4 second, back to mid, after another 4 "
"seconds it would be moved to 1700 again, then finally after 4 more "
"seconds it would be moved back to mid."
msgstr ""
"在上述示例中，连接到输出通道 8 的舵机将移动到 PWM 1700，4 秒后返回中间位置，再过 4 秒后再次移动到 1700，最后再过 4 "
"秒后返回中间位置。"

