msgstr "用于控制相机或天线挂载的任务指令。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:1321
#: 5d473bcc3f8e422290c91744c164bb7d
msgid ""
"This command allows you to specify a roll, pitch and yaw angle which will"
" be sent to the :ref:`camera gimbal <common-cameras-and-gimbals>`. This "
"can be used to point the camera in specific directions at various times "
"in the mission."
msgstr ""
"此指令允许您指定横滚、俯仰和偏航角度，并将其发送至 :ref:`相机云台 <common-cameras-and-"
"gimbals>`。可用于在任务的不同时刻将相机指向特定方向。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:1380
#: 241118b68abf4a4286fe8f1420af33b1
msgid "Mission Planner Settings for DO_MOUNT_CONTROL command"
msgstr "DO_MOUNT_CONTROL 指令的 Mission Planner 设置"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:1385
#: d6a75842d9f14dbd9967550b1f480be0
msgid "MAV_CMD_DO_GIMBAL_MANAGER_PITCHYAW"
msgstr "MAV_CMD_DO_GIMBAL_MANAGER_PITCHYAW"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:1389
#: 6d1180c448e942969fcdc18e115273a3
msgid ""
"Mission command to move the gimbal to the desired pitch and yaw angles "
"(in degrees)."
msgstr "将云台移动到期望俯仰和偏航角度（度）的任务指令。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:1391
#: f67691800c0b48f0b16198cabedefeab
msgid ""
"This command allows you to specify a pitch and yaw angle which will be "
"sent to the :ref:`camera gimbal <common-cameras-and-gimbals>`. This can "
"be used to point the camera in specific directions at various times in "
"the mission. Positive pitch angles are up, Negative are down.  Positive "
"yaw angles are clockwise, negative are counter clockwise."
msgstr ""
"此指令允许您指定俯仰和偏航角度，并将其发送至 :ref:`相机云台 <common-cameras-and-"
"gimbals>`。可用于在任务的不同时刻将相机指向特定方向。俯仰角正值表示向上，负值表示向下。偏航角正值为顺时针，负值为逆时针。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:1450
#: 2149099186b847f48aa2e770cf092a2a
msgid "Mission PlannerSettings for DO_GIMBAL_MANAGE_PITCHYAW command"
msgstr "DO_GIMBAL_MANAGE_PITCHYAW 指令的 Mission Planner 设置"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:1455
#: 8307f2bdfa4b4f66a2d2ffa3d0a976fc
msgid "MAV_CMD_DO_SET_CAM_TRIGG_DIST"
msgstr "MAV_CMD_DO_SET_CAM_TRIGG_DIST"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:1459
#: 85c204ab92fb426198688678741acb94
msgid ""
"Trigger the :ref:`camera shutter <common-camera-shutter-with-servo>` at "
"regular distance intervals. This command is useful in :ref:`camera survey"
" missions <common-camera-control-and-auto-missions-in-mission-planner>`. "
"To trigger the camera once, immediately after passing the DO command, set"
" param3 to 1."
msgstr ""
"以固定距离间隔触发 :ref:`相机快门 <common-camera-shutter-with-servo>`。此指令在 "
":ref:`相机航拍任务 <common-camera-control-and-auto-missions-in-mission-"
"planner>` 中很有用。如需在经过 DO 指令后立即触发相机一次，将 param3 设为 1。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:1465
#: 410197dfd49b4e349a3514fe6a1c1ba1
msgid ""
"Providing a distance of zero will stop the camera shutter from being "
"triggered."
msgstr "将距离设为零将停止相机快门的触发。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:1520
#: 3e355b6e0c1c4a89bd6b88d90d5d7f72
msgid "Mission PlannerSettings for DO_SET_CAM_TRIGG_DIST command"
msgstr "DO_SET_CAM_TRIGG_DIST 指令的 Mission Planner 设置"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:1522
#: eef525b7f7584ebf9d41e3d43e0ee0aa
msgid ""
"The above configuration will cause the camera shutter to trigger after "
"every 5m that the vehicle travels."
msgstr "上述配置将使相机快门在飞行器每飞行 5m 后触发一次。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:1529
