#~ " 0 到 1 之间的小数圈数，大于 1 的圈数必须为整数。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "The radius of the circle is "
#~ "controlled by the command parameter. A"
#~ " radius of 0 will result in the"
#~ " copter loitering at the location and"
#~ " pirouetting the specified number of "
#~ "turns. Negative radius values result in"
#~ " counter-clockwise turns instead of "
#~ "clockwise turns. Radius values over 255"
#~ " meters will be rounded down to "
#~ "the nearest 10 meter mark."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "圆圈半径由指令参数控制。半径为 0 "
#~ "时，飞行器将在原地悬停并原地旋转指定圈数。负半径值将使飞行器逆时针转圈而非顺时针。超过 255 "
#~ "米的半径值将向下取整到最近的 10 米整数。"

